Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Wet Road Construction Zone" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :description "Pedestrian wearing a yellow shirt walking in a construction zone." .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Construction barriers on the road." .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of collision with a pedestrian in a construction zone." ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

